          <li>Revenue &amp; subscription reporting</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-cream" id="nutrition">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Nutrition &amp; food safety</span>
      <p class="section-tagline">Freshly Prepared Meals. Seamlessly Delivered.</p>
      <h2>Every dish, checked before it's ever offered.</h2>
      <p>Allergen information — nut, shellfish, sesame, soy, egg, gluten, and lactose — is documented per dish, not a blanket claim across the whole menu. Special dietary claims apply to specific preparations and aren't independently lab-verified.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="allergen-banner" data-reveal>
      <div class="allergen-banner-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg><span>Allergen information available per dish</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="age-portion-note" data-reveal>
      <div class="age-portion-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20a8 8 0 1 0 0-16 8 8 0 0 0 0 16Z"/><path d="M9 10.5c0 1.5 1 3 3 3s3-1.5 3-3"/><circle cx="9.5" cy="9" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="9" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div>
      <div>
        <strong>Portioned for your child's age, not one-size-fits-all.</strong>
        <span>Every student's grade is on file, so portion size and protein content are matched to their age group — a Grade 1 plate isn't the same as a Grade 8 plate.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-4">
      <% menuItems.forEach(m => { %>
        <div class="menu-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="menu">
          <div class="menu-thumb">
            <%- include('partials/dish-image', { m: m }) %>
          </div>
          <div class="menu-card-body">
            <span class="tag"><%= m.tag %></span>
            <h3><%= m.name %></h3>
            <div class="menu-nutri"><span><%= m.calories %> kcal</span><span>·</span><span><%= m.protein %>g protein</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
    <p class="nutrition-more" data-reveal>Full ingredients, carbohydrate and fat breakdowns are on every dish's <a href="/menu">menu detail</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

